 in Coffee County came in under 90% of normal in February to March in 36 of 75 years since 1951, and in September to October in 34. In 2025 the middle ran 150% of normal in April to May and 56% in November to December. So far in 2026 it sat at 53% in February to March and 130% in May to June. Every grid had its driest year in 2007, as low as 58% on grids 18476 and 18477.</p>"}
